<title>FRANCE: AI(R) to sell one ATR 42 to Air Caledonie.</title>
<headline>AI(R) to sell one ATR 42 to Air Caledonie.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>European aircraft sale consortium Aero International (Regional) said on Friday that Air Caledonie had signed a contract to buy a new ATR 42 for delivery before the end of 1997. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>AI(R), backed by French Aerospatiale, British Aerospace and Italy's alenia, announced the contract in a statement, saying the airline already had three ATR 42 aircraft.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
